{"slug":"hello-world，Hexo","title":"Hello World，Hexo","date":"","updated":"","tags":["gossip","Hexo"],"categories":[],"cover":"/img/cover/code.jpg","excerpt":"Welcome to Hexo! This is your very first post. Check documentation for more info. If you get any problems when using Hexo, you can find the answer in troubleshooting or you can ask me on GitHub. More ","sticky":0,"contentHtml":"<p>Welcome to <a href=\"https://hexo.io/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Hexo</a>! This is your very first post. Check <a href=\"https://hexo.io/docs/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">documentation</a> for more info. If you get any problems when using Hexo, you can find the answer in <a href=\"https://hexo.io/docs/troubleshooting.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">troubleshooting</a> or you can ask me on <a href=\"https://github.com/hexojs/hexo/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">GitHub</a>.</p>\n<h2 id=\"quick-start\"><a href=\"#quick-start\">Quick Start</a></h2>\n<h3 id=\"create-a-new-post\"><a href=\"#create-a-new-post\">Create a new post</a></h3>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\"><code data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#61AFEF\">$</span><span style=\"color:#98C379\"> hexo</span><span style=\"color:#98C379\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#98C379\"> \"My New Post\"</span></span></code></pre></figure>\n<p>More info: <a href=\"https://hexo.io/docs/writing.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Writing</a></p>\n<h3 id=\"run-server\"><a href=\"#run-server\">Run server</a></h3>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\"><code data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#61AFEF\">$</span><span style=\"color:#98C379\"> hexo</span><span style=\"color:#98C379\"> server</span></span></code></pre></figure>\n<p>More info: <a href=\"https://hexo.io/docs/server.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Server</a></p>\n<h3 id=\"generate-static-files\"><a href=\"#generate-static-files\">Generate static files</a></h3>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\"><code data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#61AFEF\">$</span><span style=\"color:#98C379\"> hexo</span><span style=\"color:#98C379\"> generate</span></span></code></pre></figure>\n<p>More info: <a href=\"https://hexo.io/docs/generating.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Generating</a></p>\n<h3 id=\"deploy-to-remote-sites\"><a href=\"#deploy-to-remote-sites\">Deploy to remote sites</a></h3>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\"><code data-language=\"bash\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#61AFEF\">$</span><span style=\"color:#98C379\"> hexo</span><span style=\"color:#98C379\"> deploy</span></span></code></pre></figure>\n<p>More info: <a href=\"https://hexo.io/docs/one-command-deployment.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Deployment</a></p>"}